# Your rule content

The firebase database structure for this app is the following:

activities
    classId
    className
    teacherName
    timestamp
    type
    userId

classes
    code
    createdAt
    name
    teacherId
    updatedAt
    isPublic
    skinId
    customCertificateBadgeUrl


enrollments
    classId
    enrolledAt
    status
    studentId

quizAttempts
    classId
    correctAnswers
    questionCount
    questions [array]
        correctIndex [number]
        id
        options [array]
            text
        selectedAnswer [number]
        text
    quizId
    quizTitle
    score
    timeSpent
    timestamp
    userId


quizzes
    createdAt
    classId
    id
    questions
        correctIndex
            options (this holds all possible answers)
                text
        text (this is for question)
    teacherId
    title
    updatedAt
    badgeImage
    lessonPlan
    lessonSteps
    lessonType (full or stepped)

users 
    bio
    classes
        array in classes includes ids of classes associated to this user
    createdAt
    email
    lastLogin
    name
    phone
    role (student or teacher)
    updatedAt